====== Linksys E900 v1 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The switch and LED work fine but the wireless radio does not work (and probably won't ever work unless there is some hero who is willing to port the driver for it) as of Chaos Calmer 15.05. See dmesg output below for more details on the wireless.

Tomato and DD-WRT are better suited to the E900 as they both fully support the wireless radio of this model.

